		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[vc_row height="short"][vc_column width="1/1"][shapedimage images="2623" shape_size="big"][vc_column_text]Hello, I’m Michael :)

I’m passionate about creating colorful, educational and utilitarian applications!

My current focus is <a href="https://sketch.io/">Sketch.IO</a>. At Sketch.IO we develop design tools:
<ul>
	<li>Annotations &amp; editing for online news</li>
	<li>Colorful educational musical apps</li>
	<li>Kiosk software in science &amp; learning center installations</li>
	<li>Non-destructive illustration &amp; painting apps</li>
	<li>Promotional contests for sports teams &amp; companies</li>
	<li>Realtime collaborative apps</li>
	<li>User based product customization for printing</li>
</ul>
<h4>For business inquiries contact me at Sketch.IO:</h4>
<ul>
	<li><a href="https://sketch.io/contact.html?type=business">Contact for Businesses</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://sketch.io/contact.html?type=nonprofit">Contact for Schools &amp; Non-Profits</a></li>
</ul>
<h4>Otherwise feel free to contact me directly:</h4>
<ul>
	<li><a href="https://github.com/mudcube">Github</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://plus.google.com/+MichaelDeal">Google+</a></li>
	<li><a href="https://twitter.com/mudcube">Twitter</a></li>
</ul>
[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][/vc_row]]]></content:encoded>
