		<content:encoded><![CDATA[]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Your bones don’t break, mine do. That’s clear. Your cells react to bacteria and viruses differently than mine. You don’t get sick, I do. That’s also clear. But for some reason, you and I react the exact same way to water. We swallow it too fast, we choke.]]></excerpt:encoded>
