			<wp:comment_date_gmt><![CDATA[2010-09-30 13:05:55]]></wp:comment_date_gmt>
			<wp:comment_content><![CDATA[Hey, I love your Piano Theory widget for quick access to a keyboard on my dashboard.  I just had two suggestions to make for the app.  <br />1) The piano sounds are really soft even at 100%. I often use the app to quickly figure out the notes in the melody of songs but it&#39;s overwhelmed by any music unless I turn them way down or off.  It&#39;d be ok if the sound distorted a bit as it got louder, maybe you could have the slider go up to 200% but note that over 100% could cause some clipping.  <br />2) Related to number 1, maybe you could have an alternate distorted sound, like a simple saw tooth synthy sound that can cut through other sounds and sounds much louder.  <br />3) I usually only use the single note mode, but every time I start the app, it goes back to chord mode.  Would be really great if it remembered the last setting for the chord checkbox.  <br />Thanks!]]></wp:comment_content>
