			<wp:comment_content><![CDATA[Have been searching for a tool to assist learning of chords both by hearing and learning the letter names and keys.  Thought this to be a very useful and fun tool to use.  Couple of glitches.  One...the reverb is always on even at 0% and successive chords are mushed together.  Other...the key names don't always really match the chord name, i.e., Bmajor chord should read B D# F#, not B Eb Gb, so it is useful to find and hear a chord, but not to always learn the correct letter spelling.]]></wp:comment_content>
