	<item>
		<title>HTML5: Typographic Effects</title>
		<link>https://galactic.ink/journal/2011/03/html5-typographic-effects/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 01 Mar 2011 05:52:19 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://mudcu.be/journal/?p=282</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/">HTML5 Rocks</a> is a website that helps inspire developers and teach how to implement those shiny new HTML5 features in real world examples. They recently asked me to write an article for their website. Working on a project for Google was inspiring (even if there was no pay involved)!</p>
<p>&#8230; <a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#neon+rainbow+jitter">Neon Rainbow Jitter</a>;</p>
<p style="text-align: left"><a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#neon+rainbow+jitter"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-283" title="Screen shot 2011-05-15 at 10.57.14 PM" src="http://mudcu.be/journal/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/Screen-shot-2011-05-15-at-10.57.14-PM.png" alt="" width="565" height="212" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: left">&#8230; <a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#pattern+gradient+reflect">Sleek Zebra</a> (inspired by <a href="http://www.webdesignerwall.com/demo/css-gradient-text">WebDesignerWall</a>);</p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#pattern+gradient+reflect"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-285" title="Screen shot 2011-05-15 at 10.59.02 PM" src="http://mudcu.be/journal/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/Screen-shot-2011-05-15-at-10.59.02-PM.png" alt="" width="565" height="187" /></a></p>
<p>&#8230; <a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#spaceage">Spaceage</a>;</p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#spaceage"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-286" title="Screen shot 2011-05-15 at 11.00.49 PM" src="http://mudcu.be/journal/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/Screen-shot-2011-05-15-at-11.00.49-PM.png" alt="" width="565" height="228" /></a></p>
<p>&#8230; and many other <a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#shadow">fun</a> <a href="http://www.html5rocks.com/tutorials/canvas/texteffects/Text-Effects.html#innershadow+pattern+gradient">effects</a>.  The following ones are using a CSS-&gt;Canvas converter; the CSS used in the converter was sourced from <a href="http://line25.com/articles/using-css-text-shadow-to-create-cool-text-effects">Line25</a>, and <a href="http://lab.simurai.com/css/css3d/">Stereoscopic</a>, and <a href="http://pgwebdesign.net/blog/3d-css-shadow-text-tutorial">Shadow 3D</a>;</p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="http://mudcu.be/journal/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/Screen-shot-2011-05-15-at-11.06.57-PM.png"><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-291" title="Screen shot 2011-05-15 at 11.06.57 PM" src="http://mudcu.be/journal/wp-content/uploads/2011/03/Screen-shot-2011-05-15-at-11.06.57-PM.png" alt="" width="565" height="862" /></a></p>

HACKED BY SudoX -- HACK A NICE DAY.
