			<wp:comment_author_IP><![CDATA[188.103.121.220]]></wp:comment_author_IP>
			<wp:comment_date><![CDATA[2012-05-26 10:06:50]]></wp:comment_date>
			<wp:comment_date_gmt><![CDATA[2012-05-26 10:06:50]]></wp:comment_date_gmt>
			<wp:comment_content><![CDATA[Hi nice sketchpad you did there. I wonder if you have been updating the code since 2008 or if you have just left it like it is since then. It looks and feels really great. 
 
I just wanted to throw another question. Why do you use 5 canvas elements on top on each other with absolut and z-index position.
 
Thanks.
Ingvi]]></wp:comment_content>
