			<wp:comment_content><![CDATA[ @brunoao86 Nope... it's not normal. But, it sounds like the JSON was not read correctly.  I wish that I could use your computer, and figure out the problem.  You might try clearing your computers cache (as even if you download the new soundfont, it could be cached).  Another way to track the issue down would be to cut out all the lines from the JSON, except for one note (and remember to remove the comma at the end of the line).
 
